OL,3,GFEATURESCAt one with its audience: the
OL,4,Cshow that turned a building into a
OL,5,Cbrand
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen does a building become a brand?
OL,9,FThis week marks the 40th anniversary of
OL,10,Fone of the BBC's strangest
OL,11,Fcommissioning decisions.
OL,13,FThe popular lunchtime magazine Pebble
OL,14,FMill at One came to an end ` weeks
OL,15,Fafter an edition recorded the show's
OL,16,Fbest ratings ever.
OL,18,FThe plan ` which seen objectively did
OL,19,Fhave merit ` was to put the programme's
OL,20,Ftalent and resources into a range of
OL,21,Fprogrammes for the new daytime schedule
OL,22,Fdue to start that autumn.
OL,23,APub: 26-May-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCAt one with its audience: the
OL,4,Cshow that turned a building into a
OL,5,Cbrand
OL,6,
OL,7,FWith lots of new programmes who would
OL,8,Fneed a magazine show making handbrake
OL,9,Fturns from pop music to pensioners'
OL,10,Frights?
OL,12,FHowever the reaction from loyal viewers
OL,13,Fwas unprecedented. Huge numbers of
OL,14,Fcomplaints were received.
OL,16,FThe interesting thing looking back is
OL,17,Fthat this audience loyalty over the
OL,18,Fyears made the Pebble Mill studios
OL,19,Fsomething of a brand.
OL,23,APub: 26-May-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12103
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCAt one with its audience: the
OL,4,Cshow that turned a building into a
OL,5,Cbrand
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe BBC was extremely proud of its
OL,8,FBirmingham Broadcasting Centre ` known
OL,9,Fas Pebble Mill after its location `
OL,10,Fwhen it opened in 1971.
OL,12,FIt was the BBC's biggest investment in
OL,13,Fbricks, mortar and facilities outside
OL,14,FLondon.
OL,16,FYou could say it was the Salford or
OL,17,FPacific Quay of its day.
OL,19,FThe next year a new lunchtime show from
OL,20,Fthe foyer began. Whoever thought of the
OL,21,Fsimple name Pebble Mill at One should
OL,22,Fhave got a bonus.
OL,23,APub: 26-May-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12104
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCAt one with its audience: the
OL,4,Cshow that turned a building into a
OL,5,Cbrand
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe programme came to be seen as a
OL,8,Fflagship for the centre. Even though
OL,9,Fthe centre was also producing a huge
OL,10,Frange of much more prestigious and
OL,11,Fpopular programmes from The Archers to
OL,12,Fserious dramas.
OL,14,FBy the mid 80s, copyright labels were
OL,15,Ftagged as BBC Pebble Mill rather than
OL,16,FBBC Birmingham. (BBC Midlands was only
OL,17,Fused on regional programmes.)
OL,19,FInevitably the public may have wrongly
OL,20,Fassociated productions from Telly
OL,21,FAddicts to All Creatures Great and
OL,22,FSmall with the lunchtime show.
OL,23,APub: 26-May-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12105
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCAt one with its audience: the
OL,4,Cshow that turned a building into a
OL,5,Cbrand
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Pebble Mill closed in 2004,
OL,8,Fsomething was lost to both the Midlands
OL,9,Fand the BBC even if it was easy to
OL,10,Fargue the building was no longer fit
OL,11,Ffor purpose. Times had changed.
OL,13,FBut there is a footnote to the 1986
OL,14,Fdecision.
OL,16,FThe BBC realised it made a mistake
OL,17,Faxing Pebble Mill at One. The next
OL,18,Fyear, a new lunchtime show ` Daytime
OL,19,FLive ` took to the air.
OL,23,APub: 26-May-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,122,120,200,300,0,100
PN,12106
SC,0006
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F121A1786056988
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}                 G6/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURESCAt one with its audience: the
OL,4,Cshow that turned a building into a
OL,5,Cbrand
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was, in effect to Pebble Mill at One
OL,8,Fwhat Saturday Superstore and Going Live
OL,9,Fwere to Swap Shop.
OL,11,FThe name didn't stick though.
OL,12,FEventually the Pebble Mill name
OL,13,Freturned even though by then the
OL,14,Fprogramme was a studio chat show not a
OL,15,Fmagazine from the foyer.
OL,17,FBut today it's worth celebrating the
OL,18,Flegacy of what might have seemed like a
OL,19,Fharmless magazine show which made one
OL,20,Fof the BBC's buildings an unexpected
OL,21,Fstar.
OL,23,APub: 26-May-2026Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
